Attributes: \`name\`, \`size\` (number = px or any CSS length), \`color\`, \`stroke-width\`, \`label\` (omit for decorative icons).
CSS variables also work and cross the shadow boundary: \`--cmn-icon-size\`, \`--cmn-icon-color\`, \`--cmn-icon-color-2…\`, \`--cmn-icon-stroke-width\`.

